# Keys are for BUILDING / refreshing artifacts ONLINE: GEMINI (run the judge) + BOLNA (ingest +
# refresh the Cartesia-config proof). The FINAL CACHED DEMO needs NO keys — every artifact is
# committed and replays offline. Cartesia runs INSIDE the Bolna agent's synthesizer config
# (provider=cartesia), so no separate Cartesia key or credit balance is ever required.

# Create a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey then: cp .env.example .env
GEMINI_API_KEY=paste-key-here

# Bolna: platform.bolna.ai -> Developers -> "Generate a new API Key" (shown ONLY once).
# Used as: Authorization: Bearer <key>. Keep it secret — it is a password.
BOLNA_API_KEY=paste-key-here

# OPTIONAL / historical-only. Cartesia is configured inside the Bolna synthesizer, so this is NOT
# required to run or demo VoiceForge. It only powers the direct-TTS reproduction utilities
# (pipeline/cartesia_smoke.py, cartesia_tts_smoke.py, assemble_hero.py cartesia mode) that were
# used to originally synthesize the cached hero audio. Format sk_car_...
# CARTESIA_API_KEY=paste-key-here-only-if-reproducing-hero-audio
